{"claim_id":"CH3_001","source_path":"/sdcard/NEXUS_LLM_WIKI/raw/new/$11,684 a day selling courses at 22 (Sam Milsap).txt","statement":"يصف المصدر مساراً يبدأ بالمحتوى ثم جذب العملاء المحتملين ثم التحويل إلى عملاء لخدمة مرتفعة السعر.","evidence_type":"direct_quote","evidence_start":0,"evidence_end":430,"evidence_quote":"how Samuel Millsap is generating over $300,000 every single month with his online coaching business. And in this video, I'll break down his entire funnel, how he gets people onto his funnel, how he generates super interested leads using a simple Instagram content strategy and nurturing them through YouTube and finally how the conversion process actually looks like. So how he get people onto calls and then finally close them so","excerpt_sha256":"395f35f0a63ba05632061c85a522a984d3d42a023a5ced9aed317908cbf8938f","scope":"وصف لمسار تسويقي كما يورده المصدر؛ لا يثبت نجاحه خارج هذا المصدر.","confidence":"source_reported","status":"candidate"}
